<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Marrakesch Guide: 13 places – riad, Djemaa el-Fna, Majorelle, souks &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>2. Djemaa el-Fna</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at sunset to a rooftop terrace and eat down below afterwards. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>-7.98892,31.62583,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Jardin Majorelle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book an online ticket and come at opening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>-8.00291,31.64147,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Bahia Palace</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early before the tour groups arrive. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>-7.98194,31.62163,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Saadian Tombs</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early or shortly before closing. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>-7.98855,31.61726,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Koutoubia Mosque</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Walk through the gardens in the evening when the light is warm. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>-7.99336,31.62375,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Experiencing a hammam</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Ask about price and procedure beforehand. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>-7.9738,31.62663,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Le Jardin Secret &amp; quiet medina gardens</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Take a break in the garden café. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>-7.99005,31.63087,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Menara Gardens</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the late afternoon when the light is soft. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>-8.01917,31.61411,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Tanneries &amp; craft alleys</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Agree the price beforehand or go alone. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/marrakech/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>-7.97887,31.63371,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
